 "side": "Dark",
 "description": "This is my first attempt at this deck but it can be a beast my opponent loses 3 force bfore they can even activate and all kinds of things get played for free.",
 "strategy": "Ok this deck is pretty basic. Turn 1 before I activate I pull Executor and Reegesk. Then if I didn’t draw Search and Destroy I lose Mob points to pull it. Ok activate. If I have Watto in hand I drop him to the junkyard, if not then I use the junkyard to pull him, then I drop Reegesk to Mos Espa, this flips my objective. I use Ket Maliss to drop a docking bay and do the best I can to back up Reegesk. Ok the last thing I do during my deploy phase is use my objective to bluff out something causing my opponent to lose 2 force. They then lose 1 more during my draw phase from Search and Destroy. That’s 3 force before they can do anything about it. From there it is pretty much battles and drains and bluffing whenever I can. I have Dathcha in case my opponent holds back 2 force and I want them to use it.",
